                    <note type="editorial">
                        <p>Arthur Taylor was a printer and author of historical works.  Along with his brother <persName key="TAY06">Richard</persName>, he published some of Godwin's works. 
  He was the son of <persName key="TAY02 TAY04">John and Susannah Taylor</persName> of Norwich who also appear in the diary.</p>
                        <p>He is usually recorded in the diary as 'A Taylor' and appears frequently with his siblings; see the discussion under <persName key="TAY01">John Taylor</persName>.</p>
